1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,200
名字叫"水煮"，端上桌却是一盆红油
Called "boiled" — it arrives as a bowl of chili oil

2
00:00:02,200 --> 00:00:04,400
鱼片先在滚水里快氽
The fish slices are flash-poached first

3
00:00:04,400 --> 00:00:06,600
嫩得一夹就颤
So tender they quiver on the chopsticks

4
00:00:06,600 --> 00:00:08,800
铺一层豆芽垫底
A bed of bean sprouts underneath

5
00:00:08,800 --> 00:00:11,000
干辣椒、花椒，堆成小山
Dried chilies and peppercorns piled like a hill

6
00:00:11,000 --> 00:00:13,200
一勺滚油泼下去
Then a ladle of smoking oil goes over

7
00:00:13,200 --> 00:00:15,400
"刺啦"一声，香味炸开
A loud sizzle — the aroma explodes

8
00:00:15,400 --> 00:00:17,600
起源重庆渝北翠云乡
Born in Cuiyun, Chongqing

9
00:00:17,600 --> 00:00:19,800
从纤夫、司机的粗菜起家
It started as boatmen's and truckers' food

10
00:00:19,800 --> 00:00:22,000
1983拿奖，1985定型
Won a prize in 1983, set by 1985

11
00:00:22,000 --> 00:00:24,400
麻辣鲜香，四川人叫"巴适"
Numbing, spicy — Sichuan calls it "báshì"

12
00:00:24,400 --> 00:00:27,000
你吃辣能到几级？下集·酸菜鱼
What's your spice level? Next: pickle fish
